sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Terminal
    participant Src as odc-video-source
    participant Daemon as odc-onboard Daemon
    participant Mgr as RtspCompressorManager
    participant Bridge as RtspBridge (GStreamer)
    participant Client as odc-rtsp-monitor

    User->>Src: ./odc-video-source --video mercedes.mp4 --port 8554
    Note over Src: GStreamer: filesrc → qtdemux → h264parse → rtph264pay
    Src-->>User: Serving on rtsp://0.0.0.0:8554/stream

    User->>Daemon: ./odc-onboard --daemon --config cfg.json
    Note over Daemon: Config: rtsp.enabled=true, rtsp.auto_start_on_vpn=true
    Daemon-->>User: Socket at /run/odc-onboard/odc-onboard.sock

    User->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp start e2e-test lo 127.0.0.1
    Daemon->>Mgr: start_compressor("e2e-test", "lo", "127.0.0.1")

    Note over Mgr: Builds BridgeConfig:<br/>input_uri=rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/stream<br/>output=rtsp://0.0.0.0:8554/stream<br/>codec=h265, 800kbps, 720p30

    Mgr->>Bridge: new RtspBridge(orchestrator)
    Mgr->>Bridge: bridge->start(config)
    Note over Bridge: Ingest: rtspsrc → decode → x265enc → rtph265pay → RTSP serve

    Mgr-->>User: Started compressor: e2e-test

    User->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp status
    Daemon-->>User: e2e-test: running yes

    User->>Client: odc-rtsp-monitor rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/stream --tcp --duration 5
    Client->>Bridge: RTSP DESCRIBE / SETUP / PLAY
    Bridge-->>Client: RTP video stream (H.265 720p 800kbps)
    Client->>Client: Pad probe measures bandwidth
    Client-->>User: Avg Bandwidth: 742.3 kbps

    User->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp stop e2e-test
    Daemon->>Mgr: stop_compressor("e2e-test")
    Mgr->>Bridge: g_main_loop_quit(loop)
    Bridge-->>Mgr: Thread joins, bridge->stop()

    User->>Src: kill video source
